{"variant": "compliance", "year": 2015, "month": 7, "day": 11, "slug": "annual-shareholder-letter-9981", "variant_int": 2, "html": "<section class=\"page-banner\"><div class=\"container\"><p class=\"text-uppercase mb-1\" style=\"color:var(--gold);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.18em;font-size:.75rem\"><a href=\"/archive/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">Archive</a> &rsaquo; <a href=\"/archive/2015/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">2015</a> &rsaquo; <a href=\"/archive/2015/07/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">07</a> &rsaquo; 11</p><p style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);font-size:.72rem;margin-bottom:.4rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase\">Compliance Review &bull; OCA-2015-Q4-8844</p><h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(1.2rem,3vw,2rem);line-height:1.25\">International Trade Compliance Audit — Annual Shareholder Letter</h1><p style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:0\">ESG &amp; Sustainability Law &bull; Bastion Workforce Solutions &bull; Archived 2015-07-11</p></div></section><section style=\"padding:3rem 0;background:var(--surface)\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row g-4\"><div class=\"col-lg-8\"><div id=\"acpwb-compliance-ca1f507a-header\" style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:4px solid var(--gold);padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.5rem\">Document Information</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.3rem .8rem;font-size:.83rem;margin-bottom:.75rem\"><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Client</span><br><strong>Bastion Workforce Solutions</strong></div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Industry</span><br><strong>ESG &amp; Sustainability Law</strong></div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Audit Ref</span><br><code style=\"font-size:.75rem\">OCA-2015-Q4-8844</code></div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Version</span><br><code style=\"font-size:.75rem\">1.0-FINAL</code></div></div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\">Filed by <strong>Bette Nachum</strong>, Director, Executive Compensation Analytics &mdash; <a href=\"mailto:bette.nachum@acpwb.com\" style=\"color:var(--navy)\">bette.nachum@acpwb.com</a></div><div style=\"margin-top:.6rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.3rem\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;padding:.15rem .45rem;background:#f4f6f9;border:1px solid #dde1e8;color:#444\">ACA §1557 (nondiscrimination in health programs)</span><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;padding:.15rem .45rem;background:#f4f6f9;border:1px solid #dde1e8;color:#444\">Hart-Scott-Rodino Antitrust Improvements Act of 1976</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">1. Engagement Scope</h5><p style=\"font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333\">The scope of this review was to validate the accuracy and completeness of Bastion Workforce Solutions&#x27;s EEO-1 Component 2 pay data submission for the 2015 reporting cycle. The assessment involved reconciling source payroll and HRIS data for 152 employees against the final submission file.</p></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">2. Methodology</h5><p style=\"font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333\">The methodology for this review included an analysis of {org}&#x27;s insurance coverage for employment-related liabilities (EPLI), assessing policy limits and exclusions in the context of the compliance risks identified in this report.</p></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">3. Findings Summary</h5><div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th>Finding ID</th><th>Risk</th><th>Status</th><th>Owner</th><th>Due</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">OCA-1323-001</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">INFO</span></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">DEFERRED</span></td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem\">Account Executive</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">2015-11-28</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;max-width:240px\">Mental Health Parity (MHPAEA) non-quantitative treatment limitation (NQTL) analysis is incomplete for the current plan year</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">OCA-6620-002</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef9c3;color:#854d0e;border:1px solid #fde047\">LOW</span></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">DEFERRED</span></td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem\">Event Planner</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">2015-10-28</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;max-width:240px\">10b5-1 trading plan for 152 executives lacks required cooling-off period under amended rules</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">OCA-1186-003</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">INFO</span></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#dcfce7;color:#15803d;border:1px solid #86efac\">REMEDIATED</span></td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem\">Director of Enterprise Partnerships</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">2015-09-28</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;max-width:240px\">Personal Health Information (PHI) transmitted via unencrypted email for 152 benefits claims</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">OCA-5507-004</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef9c3;color:#854d0e;border:1px solid #fde047\">LOW</span></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#dcfce7;color:#15803d;border:1px solid #86efac\">REMEDIATED</span></td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem\">Senior Manager of Data Analytics</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">2015-09-28</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;max-width:240px\">Equity grant documentation incomplete for awards issued during the review period</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">OCA-8813-005</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef9c3;color:#854d0e;border:1px solid #fde047\">LOW</span></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#eff6ff;color:#1d4ed8;border:1px solid #93c5fd\">MONITORING</span></td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem\">Director of Legislative Affairs</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">2015-11-28</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;max-width:240px\">Union information requests for bargaining unit data were not fulfilled within the required timeframe</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">4. Detailed Findings</h5><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:1rem;padding:1rem 1.2rem\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:.55rem\"><code style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">OCA-1323-001</code><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">INFORMATIONAL</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Observation</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">Mental Health Parity (MHPAEA) non-quantitative treatment limitation (NQTL) analysis is incomplete for the current plan year</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Corrective Action Required</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The process for identifying the median employee will be enhanced to include a statistical sampling approach, with the methodology and results documented and presented to the Audit Committee.</p></div><div style=\"padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Management Response</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:.4rem\">The finding is accepted. We have implemented a manual control as an interim solution while a permanent system fix is being developed. The manual control is performed daily by the compliance team.</p><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">Owner: <strong>Account Executive</strong> &bull; Due: <strong>2015-11-28</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:1rem;padding:1rem 1.2rem\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:.55rem\"><code style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">OCA-6620-002</code><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef9c3;color:#854d0e;border:1px solid #fde047\">LOW</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Observation</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">10b5-1 trading plan for 152 executives lacks required cooling-off period under amended rules</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Corrective Action Required</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">Conduct a self-audit of all I-9 forms for employees hired in the past 12 months. Correct all identified errors and provide remedial training to all staff responsible for I-9 verification.</p></div><div style=\"padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Management Response</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:.4rem\">We concur with the finding. The process has been redesigned, and user acceptance testing is scheduled for the week of 2015-07-11. Full implementation will follow immediately after successful testing.</p><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">Owner: <strong>Event Planner</strong> &bull; Due: <strong>2015-10-28</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:1rem;padding:1rem 1.2rem\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:.55rem\"><code style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">OCA-1186-003</code><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">INFORMATIONAL</span><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#dcfce7;color:#15803d;border:1px solid #86efac\">REMEDIATED</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Observation</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">Personal Health Information (PHI) transmitted via unencrypted email for 152 benefits claims</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Corrective Action Required</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The 401(k) plan fiduciary committee shall formalize its vendor review process, including the issuance of RFPs and documentation of the selection rationale for all plan service providers.</p></div><div style=\"padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Management Response</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:.4rem\">This finding has been superseded by a subsequent internal audit finding which addresses the same root cause with a more comprehensive corrective action plan. We request this finding be closed and tracked under the new internal audit reference number.</p><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">Owner: <strong>Director of Enterprise Partnerships</strong> &bull; Due: <strong>2015-09-28</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:1rem;padding:1rem 1.2rem\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:.55rem\"><code style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">OCA-5507-004</code><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef9c3;color:#854d0e;border:1px solid #fde047\">LOW</span><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#dcfce7;color:#15803d;border:1px solid #86efac\">REMEDIATED</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Observation</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">Equity grant documentation incomplete for awards issued during the review period</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Corrective Action Required</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">Establish a formal policy recoupment tracking log and assign ownership to a designated compliance officer. All recoupment events must be documented within 30 days of trigger event and reported quarterly to the Audit Committee.</p></div><div style=\"padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Management Response</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:.4rem\">The finding is valid. A budget of $152K has been approved to procure the necessary technology to automate this control. Implementation is projected to take 47 weeks.</p><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">Owner: <strong>Senior Manager of Data Analytics</strong> &bull; Due: <strong>2015-09-28</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:1rem;padding:1rem 1.2rem\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:.55rem\"><code style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">OCA-8813-005</code><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef9c3;color:#854d0e;border:1px solid #fde047\">LOW</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Observation</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">Union information requests for bargaining unit data were not fulfilled within the required timeframe</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Corrective Action Required</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">A senior executive will be formally designated at each company establishment to be responsible for the review and certification of the annual OSHA 300A summary.</p></div><div style=\"padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Management Response</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Corrective action is complete. The revised policy was approved by the Board on 2015-07-11 and has been communicated to all employees. A copy of the communication and the approved policy is attached as evidence.</p><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">Owner: <strong>Director of Legislative Affairs</strong> &bull; Due: <strong>2015-11-28</strong></div></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:1.5rem;padding-top:1.25rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;justify-content:space-between\"><a href=\"/archive/2015/07/10/pay-equity-disclosure-strategy-6871/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\">&larr; Previous</a><a href=\"/archive/2015/07/11/annual-shareholder-letter-9981/it-disaster-recovery-plan-annual-test-results-8236/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\">Next &rarr;</a></div></div><div class=\"col-lg-4 d-none d-lg-block\"><div style=\"position:sticky;top:2rem\"><div class=\"acpwb-card mb-3\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.7rem\">Audit Record</div><dl class=\"mb-0\" style=\"font-size:.82rem\"><dt style=\"opacity:.55;font-size:.68rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em\">Audit Ref</dt><dd class=\"mb-2\" style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.75rem;opacity:.7\">OCA-2015-Q4-8844</dd><dt style=\"opacity:.55;font-size:.68rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em\">Date</dt><dd class=\"fw-700 mb-2\">2015-07-11</dd><dt style=\"opacity:.55;font-size:.68rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em\">Organization</dt><dd class=\"fw-700 mb-2\">Bastion Workforce Solutions</dd><dt style=\"opacity:.55;font-size:.68rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em\">Findings</dt><dd class=\"mb-2\">5 total</dd><dt style=\"opacity:.55;font-size:.68rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em\">Record ID</dt><dd class=\"mb-0\" style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.75rem;opacity:.7\">ca1f507a</dd></dl><